WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.320
The European Commission, the General Court and the Court of Justice each played a different part in the Apple Ireland tax case.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:12.640
2016. The European Commission adopts its state aid decision.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:17.320
2020. The General Court annuls the Commission’s decision.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:24.160
2024. The Court of Justice sets aside that judgment and confirms the Commission decision.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:30.720
The full timeline links to the decisions and shows what happened to the escrow funds in 2025.
